<v Alex Blumberg>One of the many ideas that Susan introduced to our household was the concept of the nickname. I think that's all I want to say about Chicken Legs and Mophead.
<v Alex Blumberg>苏珊引入我们家庭的众多概念之一就是绰号。我想关于“鸡腿”和“拖把头”我只想说这么多。

00:35:39.850 --> 00:35:45.170
<v Alex Blumberg>I'd gone to my mother to fill in gaps in my memory of Susan, but she didn't remember much more than I did.
