<v Alex Blumberg>Hi. My name is Alex Blumberg and I'm calling from a radio program called This American Life. And this is probably a very strange phone call to receive. But I was wondering, first of all, do you remember me?
<v Alex Blumberg>嗨。我是亚历克斯·布卢姆伯格，我打电话来是来自一个叫《美国生活》的广播节目。这可能是一个非常奇怪的电话。但我想问问，首先，你还记得我吗？

