<v Alex Blumberg>Probably, probably. And you said, did he say something you? And I said, no, he didn't say anything to me. And you said, he said something to you, didn't he? And you were about to get out of the car and kick that guy's ass. I'm sure.
<v Alex Blumberg>应该是，应该是。你当时说，他跟你说了什么吗？我说，没，他没对我说话。你说，他肯定对你说了什么，对吧？然后你差点下车去踢那个家伙的屁股。我敢肯定。

