00:42:17.600 --> 00:42:27.870
<v Alex   Blumberg>Do you remember a time-- it was like maybe six or seven or eight years after you babysat us. And I was working--
<v Alex   Blumberg>你记得有一次吗——那大概是你当完我们保姆六、七、八年后。那时我在工作——

